# Settings

Ctrl Click, Disable shadows, Disable fog, Always Day, Disable shift walk, and Prevent AFK kick live in `Dashboard/Dashboard.lua`. They start on. Infinite jump, No clip, Enhanced visuals, and Lower bridge live there too and start off. Do not save any of them.

Script-specific settings stay on that script's settings page and in its `saveConfig`.

Keep the UI to a label and a control. No hint text.

```lua
-- BAD
Text = "Click the key, then press a new one."

-- GOOD
Text = "Toggle key"
```
